# (1.4.0, the user's: song structure) Song mode on GLO's second page (Endless, Song, Set: the player's, global as
# Tune, kept by a save); the Song page HOME's second (Intro, Main, Outro in bars, a phrase a click; Kind, the piece's:
# Basic Pulse first); PLAY a song from its intro; the knobs the song's moves leave be; HOME held + PLAY the outro from
# the next phrase, again back to the main; a song's end: PLAY off; Set: the next piece from its intro as the tails die,
# the last piece's end: it rests
listen
wait 1500
expect song 0
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 400
expect view 28
said Song mode page: Mode Endless
spin K1 1
wait 300
said Mode Song
expect par158 1
# HOME, HOME again: the Song page
tap HOME
wait 200
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 27
said Song page, Song: Intro 32 bars, Main 160 bars, Outro 32 bars, Kind Pulse
spin K1 -2
wait 300
said Intro 16 bars
spin K2 -16
wait 300
said Main 32 bars
spin K3 -2
wait 300
said Outro 16 bars
expect par159 2
expect par160 4
expect par161 2
expect par162 1
spin K4 -1
wait 300
said Kind Ambient
spin K4 1
wait 300
expect par162 1
# PLAY: off, then a song from its intro (the section's word INTRO; the song line)
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect playing 0
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect playing 1
expect song 1
expect songbo 48
# the knobs as they were (the kick's Density, the hats' Hits, the Cutoff): the song's moves are around them
expect par116 100
expect par7 8
expect par12 40
wait 30000
expect song 2
# HOME held + PLAY: the outro from the next phrase; again: back to the main (four phrases on at least)
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
wait 300
said OUTRO NEXT PHRASE
expect playing 1
expect songbo 24
expect view 27
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
wait 300
said OUTRO OFF
expect songbo 56
expect song 2
# the song to its end: the outro, then PLAY off
wait 80000
expect song 3
wait 30000
expect song 4
expect playing 0
said RESTING
# Set (kept by a save and a reboot): Pressure's song, short, then Haze's from its intro, the last piece: then it rests
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 300
spin K1 1
wait 300
expect par158 2
turn PRESET 7
wait 500
expect piece 7
tap HOME
wait 200
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 27
spin K1 -4
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -4
wait 300
expect par159 0
expect par160 4
expect par161 0
turn PRESET -1
wait 500
expect piece 6
expect par158 2
spin K1 -4
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -4
wait 300
press GLO
wait 700
release GLO
wait 300
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 36
expect par158 2
expect piece 6
expect par160 4
expect playing 1
expect song 2
wait 80000
expect piece 7
expect playing 1
wait 100000
expect piece 7
expect playing 0
expect song 4
